PMIP6-IPv4-Home-Address     505    5.2       Address
PMIP6-DHCP-Server-Address   504    5.4       Address
Mobile-Node-Identifier      506    5.6       UTF8String
Calling-Station-Id          31     5.7       UTF8String
Service-Selection           493    5.8       UTF8String
Service-Configuration       507    5.9       Grouped


; Type: Reused AVPs
